{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12125","headline":"独往覆釜山寄郎士元 · 钱起","name":"独往覆釜山寄郎士元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏心无远近，芳月好登望。\n胜事引幽人，山下复山上。\n将寻洞中药，复爱湖外嶂。\n古壁苔入云，阴溪树穿浪。\n谁言世缘绝，更惜知音旷。\n莺啼绿萝春，回首还惆怅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}